{
  "metadata": {
    "name": "Convoy Escape",
    "owner": "dcsturman@gmail.com",
    "description": "Ten Void Traders and two Gazelle escorts, 150,000 km out from a small moon whose jump limit is 200,000 km, try to get clear and jump. Five corsairs, three Fiery gunships and two Lionsbanes, wait 40,000 km further out on the same side, across the convoy's shortest way out. Well played, the corsairs stop the convoy; badly played, it gets away."
